      "short_title": "Verify by Doing",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Uses tool execution and inspection to revise Actor and Evaluator instructions, rubrics and skills, retaining them across improvement rounds; Actor adoption requires support from its own fresh output. Model weights stay fixed. Harnesses and history reset between independent tasks, so cross-task transfer and sustained long-term improvement remain untested.",
      "summary_zh": "通过工具执行与核查共同修改 Actor 和 Evaluator 的指令、评判规则及技能，保留到后续改进轮次；Actor 的采纳须由其自身的新输出支持。模型权重固定，独立任务之间重置 Harness 与历史，跨任务迁移及长期持续改进尚未验证。",
      "title": "Verify by Doing: Co-Evolving Agent Execution and Evaluation without External Feedback",
      "updated": "2026-11-11T10:07:09Z",
      "version": 1,
      "week": "2026-W46",
      "window_status": "in_window"
    },
