      "short_title": "HyperSkill",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Compiles and retains protocol instructions from failure types in training trajectories, then freezes them for reuse across test questions; a skill library also evolves from feedback. Harness inclusion is limited to the protocol-prompt component. Templates and the execution mechanism stay fixed, retrieved skills are disabled on most datasets, and overall gains cannot all be attributed to hypergraph skill evolution. Counterfactual admission uses model judgments.",
      "summary_zh": "根据训练轨迹的失败类型组合并保留协议指令，冻结后在测试问题间复用；技能库另按反馈演化。Harness 纳入限于协议提示组件，模板和执行机制固定，多数数据集关闭检索技能注入，不能把整体收益全归超图技能演化。反事实准入使用模型判断。",
      "title": "HyperSkill: Training-Free Omnimodal GRPO via Hypergraph-Indexed Skill-Library Evolution",
      "updated": "2026-11-11T08:20:21Z",
      "version": 1,
      "week": "2026-W46",
      "window_status": "in_window"
