      "short_title": "AskALCF",
      "source_hits": [
        "s2-citations"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Human experts iteratively revise diagnostic rules, judge skills and an override gate against prespecified target and control cases, retaining accepted Harness versions and checking a session-disjoint evaluation split. This is a human-guided Harness-improvement evaluation. No automatically generated knowledge change has been approved, merged and re-indexed in the deployed corpus, so it does not establish autonomous production repair.",
      "summary_zh": "人工专家按预定目标与控制案例迭代诊断规则、judge 技能和覆盖门，保留通过检查的 Harness 版本，并用按会话分开的评估集检查。属于人工引导的 Harness 改进评测；自动生成的知识变更尚未获批合并到已部署语料并重建索引，不能称生产系统已自主修复。",
      "title": "AskALCF: A Self-Improving Agentic System for Intelligent HPC User Support",
      "updated": "2026-11-11T16:38:54Z",
      "version": 1,
      "week": "2026-W46",
      "window_status": "in_window"
    }
